// The second stand-in plays the first one's table as it is: the same moves,
// under the same move ids. It borrows with no prefixes and authors no moves of
// its own, so there is one table to tune (`smash_duelist_a.ron`). What makes
// it the lighter build is its weight, which the demo states on the character.
(
    schema_version: 1,
    entities: [
        (
            id: "smash_duelist_b",
            contracts: (
                borrows: Some((
                    archetype: "smash_duelist_a",
                    prefixes: [],
                )),
            ),
        ),
    ],
)
